     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "557058:bfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271",
           "text": "@Joshua Allan Westgard"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ", ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
           "text": "@Danny Bernstein"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ": All of the bag files are in the top directory and the data directory is just like the export directory, so, for export, I think you'd just need to add:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "bagit.py --validate /path/to/export",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "verify.py /path/to/export/data",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "(I'm assuming verify.py already handles a -r that is not the base URL, as well as user-supplied predicates. bagit.py would also need to be added to the requirements. Import might be more complicated ...)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/LibraryOfCongress/bagit-python"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/LibraryOfCongress/bagit-python",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
